        shortAnswer: 'Preload fonts with <link rel="preload" as="font" crossorigin>. Use font-display: swap for FOUT or optional for best performance. Preconnect to font CDNs. Self-host in WOFF2 with character subsetting. Use size-adjust to minimize layout shift.',
